Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"bf31": "<h2 id=\"第-31-法-三传递生人举荐-得人举荐\">第 31 法　三传递生人举荐：得人举荐</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　生干客胜，生支主胜</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"递生格-得人举荐\">递生格：得人举荐</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">此格有二等，一自初传生中，中生末传，末传生日干；一自末生中传，中传生初传，初传生日干。凡占值二例，必隔三隔四有人于上位推荐之意，所谓皆赖众人之说。如欲干官及请举文状，皆宜得之，必得始终成就也。惟宜详初末空亡，如值空亡者，虽有举荐之心，终无成就之实，乃便作闲话多亦心少之语也。如辛丑日，卯加丑为初传，生其中传巳，中传巳生末传未，未土生辛干，此中空末落空，如年月并干事人命填实可成。又辛酉日干上寅，癸未日干上卯，甲子、壬申、壬辰、甲申、壬寅、壬子、壬戌并干上午；丙子、丙寅、丙辰、丙午、丙申、丙戌干上申，三传申亥寅，此数日内有传空者、有传不空者，如丙子初中空、丙寅中末空。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 31 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传递生有两类：一是初传生中传、中传生末传、末传生日干；二是末传生中传、中传生初传、初传生日干。占课得此，必得隔三隔四有人向上推荐、得扶持而有所成就。如欲拜见官宦或递请文状，皆宜，必有成就。只是要看初末不要是空亡，如是空亡，则主虽有举荐之心、但无举荐之实，只是当做闲话，并无多少真心。例如辛丑日第十一局，卯加丑为初传，卯木生中传巳火，巳火生末传未土，未土生日干辛金，但中传空亡，如果有太岁、月将、行年、本命填实，亦作举荐断。又辛酉日第九局干上寅；癸未日第十一局干上卯；甲子日第九局、壬申日第六局、壬辰日第六局、甲申日第九局、壬寅日第六局、壬子日第六局、壬戌日第六局，干上午；丙子、丙寅、丙辰、丙午、丙申、丙戌日第十局，干上申、三传申亥寅。皆属此例。（按：辛丑属甲午旬、空辰巳，本盘仅中传巳空亡、末传未土不空；页首原文<q class=\"yw\">此中空末落空</q>之<q class=\"yw\">末落空</q>与盘图不符，此从盘图。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛丑日第 11 局　月将 巳 加占时 卯　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 巳 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：递生格 · 辛丑日第十一局（卯加丑），卯生巳、巳生未、未生日干辛（得人举荐·中传巳空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"将生财神格-宜于取财\">将生财神格：宜于取财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">将生财神格，缘三传作财，其天将又生财神者。大宜取财，如六丙日酉加巳夜。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 31 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传作财，其天将又生财神，为将生财神格。占得此格，大都宜于取财。例如六丙日，酉加巳，夜占。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙戌日第 9 局　月将 寅 加占时 戌　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：将生财神格 · 丙戌日第九局（夜占·酉加巳），三传酉丑巳金局作财、天将又生财神（宜于取财）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"支干相生格-有福无畏\">支干相生格：有福无畏</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">支干相生格，如壬戌日干上申，支上未土生申金，金来生日，可无畏未为鬼，然后作福。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 31 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支上神生干上神，干上神又生干，为支干相生格。例如壬戌日第四局，干上神申金生壬水，支上神未土生申金，虽然未为日鬼，但亦不畏，可作吉祥的推断。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬戌日第 4 局　月将 卯 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 寅 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：支干相生格 · 壬戌日第四局，干上申生壬、支上未生申金（层层相生·有福无畏）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"两面刀格-初吉终凶\">两面刀格：初吉终凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">两面刀格，如六戊日伏吟，巳申寅，末传寅能助初生干，亦能克干，俗谚云，成也萧何、败也萧何，作两面刀。外有三传生干、天将又生传者，例如六癸日三传酉丑巳，或巳丑酉，昼占，天将贵常勾。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 31 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　末传为日鬼，初传为干之父母，末传日鬼生初传父母、父母生干，初必吉庆；但至末传为日鬼克干，终为凶祸，为两面刀格。如六戊日伏吟课，三传巳申寅，末传寅木生巳火、火生戊土，但寅木克戊土，为两面刀格。俗谚说<q class=\"yw\">成也萧何、败也萧何</q>，可比喻此格。另外，三传生干、天将又生三传，例如六癸日，三传酉丑巳或三传巳丑酉，昼占，天将贵常勾，占断与此格相近。〔历史典故·成也萧何败也萧何：萧何荐韩信使其成汉朝开国之臣，后又设计骗韩信入宫被吕后所杀，《毕法赋》以此喻两面刀格初有吉庆、终必遭殃。〕</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊辰日第 1 局　月将 辰 加占时 辰　（伏吟·自任）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 申 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：两面刀格 · 戊辰日第一局（伏吟），末传寅木助巳生戊（初吉）却又克戊土（终凶）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：三传递生至干，隔三隔四有人推荐</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传递生（初生中、中生末、末生干，或反向）至日干。</p>\n<p>⭐ 隔三隔四有人推荐、皆赖众人之说，宜干官请举；初末空亡则有心无实（闲话多赤心少）。</p>\n<hr>", "bf32": "<h2 id=\"第-32-法-三传互克众人欺-共相欺凌\">第 32 法　三传互克众人欺：共相欺凌</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　克干客败，克支主败</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"递克格-有人害我\">递克格：有人害我</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">此例亦有二等，一初克中，中克末，末克日干；一末克中，中克初，初克日干。凡占值此二例，必有人递互而相克害我也，或使众口一词、总相欺凌，或如常人所为凶横，遂被他人雷攻状论。如或见在朝官占得此课，宜自检束提防，恐有台阁上言之患。如丙辰日初传寅加酉，克中传未，其中传未克末传子，末传子克日干丙火。辛酉日干上卯，己巳日伏吟，六戊日伏吟，如丙子日末传寅加未，克中传未，中传未克初传子，初传子克丙火日干。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 32 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传递克有两类：一是初传克中传、中传克末传、末传克日干；二是末传克中传、中传克初传、初传克日干。占得这两种情况，主有人害我，或使众口一词、共相欺凌，或因作为凶横而被他人群起攻之。如为官者占得此课，则宜自我检省、约束提防，恐有台阁弹劾之患。如丙辰日第八局，初传寅加酉、克中传未，未克末传子，末传子克日干丙火。辛酉日第七局干上卯；己巳日第一局伏吟；六戊日伏吟。皆属此例。又如丙子日第六局，末传寅加未、克中传未，未克初传子，初传子克丙火日干。与31法递生成对：递生=得人举荐、递克=众人欺凌。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙辰日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 未 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：递克格 · 丙辰日第八局（寅加酉），初传寅克中未、未克末子、末子克日干丙（有人害我·末传子空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"求财大获格-大获钱财\">求财大获格：大获钱财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">求财大获格，如庚辰日干上丑，三传寅未子，自庚金克初传寅为财，初传寅木克中传未土，中传未土克末传子水，总为财，故求财可以大获。此法极好，他课例推。又如乙酉日未加寅，或如乙丑日干上酉，三传寅未子俱同。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 32 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　求财大获格，如庚辰日第八局，干上丑，三传寅未子，庚金克寅木、初传为财，初传寅木克中传未土，中传克末传子水，均为财，故求财可以大获，此法为大吉之课。又如乙酉日第八局未加寅；乙丑日第八局干上酉、三传寅未子，亦同此例。（此为递克格之变格：三传递互相克、但一一皆作日财，故转凶为大吉。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚辰日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 未 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：求财大获格 · 庚辰日第八局，三传寅未子递克但皆作日财（大获钱财）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"土将助财格-大宜求财\">土将助财格：大宜求财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">土将助财格，如六丙日酉加巳，三传皆财，夜将又皆土神，尽生起财神，大宜求财事，尤宜成合万事，却不利父母，占病列，兼此人不义，多贪横发。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 32 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　土将助财格，例如六丙日，酉加巳，三传为财，夜将又皆为土神，土生金、天将生财神，大都宜于求财，尤其宜于成合事，但不利于父母、占病亦为凶。如此人不义，多发横财。（此盘丙子日第九局，与第28法空财格同一课局。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙子日第 9 局　月将 寅 加占时 戌　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：土将助财格 · 丙子日第九局（夜占·酉加巳），三传酉丑巳皆财、夜将皆土神生财（大宜求财·初传酉空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"雀鬼格-防人弹劾\">雀鬼格：防人弹劾</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">雀鬼格，朱雀作日鬼加干，如在朝官，防弹章，及不宜上书献策，反受责黜。六丙日干上亥夜，六庚日干上巳暮，六甲日干上酉夜，六戊日干上卯昼，壬癸日未乘雀昼贵顺行有之，但不临干，如临年命亦可用。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 32 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　朱雀作日鬼加干，为雀鬼格。如为朝官，防有人弹劾，不宜上书献策，否则反受责黜。六丙日干上亥、夜占；六庚日干上巳；六甲日干上酉、夜占；六戊日干上卯、昼占；壬癸日未乘朱雀、昼贵顺行。不临日干而临年命，亦可依此占断。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙子日第 7 局　月将 辰 加占时 戌　（返吟·无依）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 子 → 午</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：雀鬼格 · 丙子日第七局（返吟·夜占），干上亥水鬼乘朱雀加干（防人弹劾）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"三传内战格-家藏罪犯\">三传内战格：家藏罪犯</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">三传内战格，缘三传俱下贼上，迤逦克去，递相侵伐，乃名三传内战，凡占必是有窝犯，讼自家庭而出。如癸酉日，未加寅下克上，中传子加未受克，末传巳加子亦受克，且天盘未克子，子克巳，地盘寅克未，未克子，尽相伤伐而无穷也。又如戊辰日寅加酉为发用亦同。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 32 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传均为下贼上、递相侵伐，为三传内战格。占得此格，家中必有罪犯，诉讼也自家中而出。如癸酉日第八局，未加寅为下贼上，中传子加未、受下克，末传巳加子、受下克，而且天盘未克子、子克巳，地盘寅克未、未克子，相互伤伐。又如戊辰日第八局，寅加酉发用，也是这样。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸酉日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 子 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：三传内战格 · 癸酉日第八局（未加寅），三传俱下贼上、递相侵伐（家藏罪犯）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：三传递相克或克干，众口相欺、递互相害</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传递相克害，或克日干。</p>\n<p>⭐ 必有人递互相克、众口相欺，或遭雷攻状论；在朝官宜自检束、防台阁上言之患。</p>\n<hr>", "bf33": "<h2 id=\"第-33-法-有始无终难变易-先易后难与先难后易\">第 33 法　有始无终难变易：先易后难与先难后易</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　占兵有先后，互为胜负</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"有始无终格-先明后暗\">有始无终格：先明后暗</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">此一句，乃是二项事体。夫有始无终者，乃因初传是日之长生，末传为干之墓是也。夫难变易者，乃初为干墓，末为干之长生是也。如乙未日，初传亥加未为干之长生，末传未加卯为干墓。占得此例者，如初起谋事之时如花似锦，后将必无成合。又如乙丑日亥加丑，初传亥、末传未，皆自生传墓也，亦如前说。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 33 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　这一法可分为两种情况。一为有始无终：初传为日之长生、末传为日墓，即自生传墓，主占事初始繁花似锦、一片光明，最后却空空如也、一事无成。如乙未日第九局，初传亥加未为干之长生，末传未加卯为干墓；占得此例者，开始谋事之时如花似锦，最终必然不能成功。再如乙丑日第三局，三传亥酉未，初传亥水为乙木之长生，末传未土为乙木之墓，是自生传墓，此课初空中陷、仅末传未墓坐实，故自始至终无一吉庆，与前例同。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙未日第 9 局　月将 亥 加占时 未　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>亥 → 卯 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：有始无终格 · 乙未日第九局（亥加未），初传亥为乙长生、末传未为乙墓（自生传墓·先明后暗）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"难变易格-先暗后明\">难变易格：先暗后明</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">（承上·难变易者，乃初为干墓、末为干之长生是也。）又如丙寅日戌加寅，初传戌为干墓，末传寅乃丙火长生之地，占事先难后易。又如壬子、壬寅二日，辰加寅为初传，申加午为末传，此乃自墓传生，先迷后醒，如占得此例，谋事之初虽值艰难，已后却有成合，凡占未免先暗后明。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 33 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　一为难变易：初传为日墓、末传为日之长生，谋事虽开始比较艰难、但经过努力后终有成，主先难后易。如丙寅日第五局，初传戌土为丙墓，中传午火为干旺，末传寅木为日之长生，占事先难后易。又如壬子日第十一局、壬寅日第十一局，初传辰土为日墓，末传申金为日之长生，占事主先迷后醒、先暗后明，若占得此例，事初艰难、但终有所成。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙寅日第 5 局　月将 丑 加占时 巳　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 午 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：难变易格 · 丙寅日第五局，初传戌为丙墓、末传寅为丙长生（自墓传生·先暗后明·初传戌空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"舍损就益格-自微至显\">舍损就益格：自微至显</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">舍损就益格，如甲辰日丑加甲，丑乃日之破碎，支上卯又作六害，又是干之羊刃，宜弃此而就三传子亥戌为生干，凡占不免舍无益而就亨旺也。占得此例，一则有寿，二则自微至显。又如甲子日亥加甲，六月占，乃父母爻作空亡，又是死气，又为木之长生，主父母灾，如父母殁后不论。余极多，仿此。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 33 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　舍损就益格，如甲辰日第二局，丑加甲，丑为日破碎煞，支上卯作六害，又是日羊刃煞，宜弃此而就三传，三传子亥戌，初传、中传生甲木，末传为日财。占课得此，不免舍无益而就亨旺。此例一主高寿，二主自微贱而至显达。再如甲子日第四局，亥加甲，六月占，为父母爻作空亡，又是死气，又为木之长生，主父母有灾；但如父母已殁，则不以此论。余例极多。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲辰日第 2 局　月将 巳 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 亥 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：舍损就益格 · 甲辰日第二局（丑加甲），弃干上丑破碎六害羊刃、就三传子亥戌生干（自微至显）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：初长生末干墓则有始无终、反之先难后易</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　初传日之长生、末传干之墓（有始无终）；反之初墓末长生（难变易）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 前者初谋如锦后无成；后者先难后易、先暗后明。</p>\n<hr>", "bf34": "<h2 id=\"第-34-法-苦去甘来乐里悲-先苦后甜与先乐后悲\">第 34 法　苦去甘来乐里悲：先苦后甜与先乐后悲</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　不成功处反成功</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"苦去甘来格-先苦后甜\">苦去甘来格：先苦后甜</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">此一句亦宜分为二项说，且夫苦去甘来者。如戊午日，末传申生中传亥水，中传水生初传寅木，而克日干之戊土，诚为被寅木之苦，殊不知反赖末之申金部克其寅，又为戊土之长生，乃应苦去甘来之喻也。凡占未免先受磨折，后却安逸。又如六戊日伏吟，乃初克中，中克末，末克日干，亦是先被寅苦，殊不知又赖寅径生其巳火而生戊干也，以上二例，亦可作成败萧何。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 34 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　这一法可分为两种情况。一为苦去甘来：末传先为忌神、后为喜神，喜忌集于一身，但因居于末传为喜，故为先苦后甜。如戊午日第四局，寅鬼自干上发用，三传寅亥申，初是申金生亥水、亥水生寅鬼克干；当传至末传申金，又冲克干上及初传二鬼，故为苦去甘来之象。占课得此，未免先受折磨、后却得安逸。（以上二例亦可作<q class=\"yw\">成也萧何、败也萧何</q>解。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊午日第 4 局　月将 卯 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 亥 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：苦去甘来格 · 戊午日第四局，寅鬼发用、末传申金克寅又为戊长生（先苦后甜）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"乐里悲格-先乐后悲\">乐里悲格：先乐后悲</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">（承上·乐里悲者，末传先为喜神、后为忌神，先得安逸而后成空悲。）如六戊日伏吟课，虽初克中、中克末、末克日干，然末传寅生干上巳、巳火生戊土（详见苦去甘来格原文）。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 34 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　二为乐里悲，是先乐后悲之意，末传先为喜神、后为忌神，主先得安逸、后成空悲。如六戊日（戊戌日第一局）伏吟课，三传巳申寅，虽是初克中、中克末、末克日干，但末传寅生干上巳、巳火生戊土。以上两例，可解为<q class=\"yw\">成也萧何、败也萧何</q>。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊戌日第 1 局　月将 巳 加占时 巳　（伏吟·自任）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 申 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：乐里悲格 · 戊戌日第一局（伏吟），三传巳申寅递克日干、末传寅反生巳（先乐后悲·初传巳空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"一喜一悲格-忧中有喜-喜中藏忧\">一喜一悲格：忧中有喜、喜中藏忧</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">一喜一悲格，如癸亥日，干上戌乘龙克日，乃幸中不幸；支上申乘虎生日，乃不幸中幸。又癸卯日干上申乘虎，支上戌乘龙；又壬寅、壬子，戌加子发用，夜将同。如干上长生于月令无气，却喜传中见鬼，乃甲日上见亥，月令无气，传中见申酉为可生亥水也，亦名不幸中幸。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 34 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　吉将乘凶神、或凶神乘吉将，为一喜一悲格。占事逢此，主忧中有喜、喜中藏忧。如癸亥日第四局（夜占），干上戌乘青龙克日、为幸中之不幸；支上申乘白虎生日干、为不幸中之幸。又癸卯日第六局，干上申乘白虎、支上戌乘青龙；又壬寅日、壬子日第三局，戌加子发用，夜将亦同此断。又干上长生于月令而无气、但传中见鬼，如甲日上见亥、月令无气、传中见申酉生亥水，亦名不幸中幸。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸亥日第 4 局　月将 未 加占时 戌　（知一）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 寅 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：一喜一悲格 · 癸亥日第四局（夜占），干上戌乘青龙克日、支上申乘白虎生日（忧中有喜喜中藏忧）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"乐里生忧格-坐待时机\">乐里生忧格：坐待时机</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">乐里生忧格，如庚寅日干上巳乃庚金之长生，支上亥乃寅木之长生，此乃先各有长生之意，然后递互相参，其庚金反被亥水脱，寅木又被巳火脱，却反为两边脱盗，凡占皆然。又甲申日干上亥、支上巳同前。庚辰日干上戌生干，支上午辰，此例止宜坐待用事，尽有其益，如若动，其支干皆坐于克乡。如庚午日干上辰土生庚金，支上寅木生午火，亦宜坐用，倘动，其支干坐于脱气乡。如庚子日干上巳作干之长生，殊不知巳火亦能克庚金，且支上酉生支，殊不知水败于酉。如癸酉、癸丑、癸巳三日，酉加癸昼占，三传虽金生日，其天将皆来伤日，虽有面前之生，背后反为深害，占病死，占讼刑，乃应俗谚云：贪得一粒粟，失却半年粮。凡占俱如是。如庚辰日干上巳，虽曰日之长生，却被末传生中传、中传生初传之巳火而克庚干。丙申日夜占，干上申，三传申亥寅，初传申加巳作日之财，受上下夹克而无用，中传为日之鬼，末传乘虎遁壬水克干，先是初生中、中生末、末生日干，后却变出许多不美，亦如前说。已上诸例，变宫商薤露。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 34 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干上神生干或为干之长生，支上神生支也是支之长生，本为极美；但一合而观之，却成干上神脱支、支上神脱干，或干支上神互相冲克，是乐中生忧之象。如庚寅日第四局，庚上巳火乃庚之长生、支上亥水乃寅木长生，各有长生之情；但庚金被支上亥水脱泄、寅木被干上巳火脱泄，且巳火与亥水互相冲克，反主乐中有忧，只宜坐待时机、动则被脱。又甲申日干上亥、支上巳同前。庚辰日干上戌生干、支上午辰，宜坐不宜动。（书中另举庚午、庚子、癸酉癸丑癸巳、庚辰、丙申夜占诸例，皆<q class=\"yw\">贪得一粒粟、失却半年粮</q>之意。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚寅日第 4 局　月将 卯 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 寅 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：乐里生忧格 · 庚寅日第四局，干上巳庚长生、支上亥寅长生，然两边脱盗互冲（乐中生忧·宜坐待）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"恩多怨深格-恩反成仇\">恩多怨深格：恩反成仇</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">恩多怨深格，缘干生初恩也。初生中，中生末，末却克日干，反成仇是也。如己巳日，申加巳生中传之亥水，中传水生末传之寅木，反克日干之己土。乙亥、乙未、乙巳、乙卯四日午加亥用。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 34 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干生初、初生中、中生末、末却克日干、反成仇，为恩多怨深格：开始是恩、后来成怨。如己巳日第十局，申加巳生中传之亥水，中传水生末传寅木，寅木克日干己土，属此格。乙亥、乙未、乙巳、乙卯四日第六局，午加亥发用，亦属此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己巳日第 10 局　月将 酉 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 亥 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：恩多怨深格 · 己巳日第十局（申加巳），干生初、初生中、中生末、末传寅反克己干（恩反成仇·中传亥空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"不幸中幸格-凶中有吉\">不幸中幸格：凶中有吉</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">不幸中幸、幸中不幸格，缘白虎却作长生，青龙却乘日鬼是也。凡占皆然。如六戊日伏吟，昼占三重白虎作长生，乃不幸中幸；如夜占三重青龙作日干之鬼，乃幸中不幸。外有戊己日返吟，三月占，生气克日，主病，死气生日主生。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 34 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　白虎却作长生，为不幸中幸格，主凶事之中有吉事。如六戊日（戊子日第一局）伏吟课，昼占，三重白虎作长生，为不幸中幸。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊子日第 1 局　月将 巳 加占时 巳　（伏吟·自任）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 申 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：不幸中幸格 · 戊子日第一局（伏吟·昼占），三重白虎（乘申）作长生（凶中有吉）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"幸中不幸格-吉中有凶\">幸中不幸格：吉中有凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">（同不幸中幸格原文·青龙却乘日鬼是也。）如六戊日伏吟，夜占三重青龙作日干之鬼，乃幸中不幸。外有戊己日返吟，三月占，生气克日主病，死气生日主生。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 34 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　青龙却乘日鬼，为幸中不幸格，主吉事之中有凶事。如六戊日（戊子日第一局）伏吟课，夜占，三重青龙（乘寅木日鬼）作日鬼，为幸中不幸。另外，戊己日返吟课、三月占，生气克日主病、死气生日主生。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊子日第 1 局　月将 戌 加占时 戌　（伏吟·自任）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 申 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：幸中不幸格 · 戊子日第一局（伏吟·夜占），三重青龙（乘寅）作日鬼（吉中有凶）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：末生中、中生初、初克干，末又冲初生干，先苦后甘</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　末生中、中生初、初克干，但末传又冲克初传并生干。</p>\n<p>⭐ 先受磨折、后却安逸，不成功处反成功。</p>\n<hr>", "bf35": "<h2 id=\"第-35-法-人宅受脱俱招盗-脱赚失盗\">第 35 法　人宅受脱俱招盗：脱赚失盗</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　占兵主客俱不利</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"干支俱脱格-人宅失盗\">干支俱脱格：人宅失盗</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">此例亦有二等，一则支上干上皆乘脱气；一则干上脱支，支上脱干。以上二例，凡占人被脱赚，家宅必被盗窃财物，如占病定然起盖屋宅费用，以致心气脱弱而成虚惫，宜服补元气药饵获瘥。内有支干递互相脱者及相交涉，必是我欲脱漏彼，彼亦早办脱漏我也。既各怀脱漏之意，故应道典云：天网恢恢，疏而不漏。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 35 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　此法分为两类：一是支上、干上皆乘脱气；二是干上脱支、支上脱干。占得此课，主被人欺骗、家宅被盗、丢失财物。占病则主因盖屋宅的费用而导致心气虚弱、疲惫，宜服药饵来补元气、方可获愈。（此格为总述二等脱气，无固定课盘。）</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"干支互脱格-各怀脱漏\">干支互脱格：各怀脱漏</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">（承干支俱脱格第二类：干上脱支、支上脱干。）内有支干递互相脱者及相交涉，必是我欲脱漏彼、彼亦早办脱漏我也。既各怀脱漏之意，故应道典云：天网恢恢，疏而不漏。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 35 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干上脱支、支上脱干，支干递互相脱、相交涉，为干支互脱格。必是我欲脱漏彼、彼亦早办脱漏我，各怀脱漏之意，故应道典云<q class=\"yw\">天网恢恢，疏而不漏</q>。（无固定课盘。）</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷空乘玄格-人宅失盗\">陷空乘玄格：人宅失盗</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">遥克、昴星、别责，乘空落空为初传发用，将乘元武者，凡占定主失脱，此法极验。如乙亥日蒿矢，酉元加亥用；丙子日弹射，申元加子用昼将；己巳日弹射，亥元加酉；辛丑日别责，巳元加申夜将；庚午日昴宿，戌加酉昼将夜将有之。又有庚子日元首，辰空元加子昼将皆乘元武；辛亥卯加戌昼将，此等日乃空亡乘元武为用，但初传不系遥克并昴星。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 35 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　遥克、昴星、别责课，乘空、落空为初传发用，天将乘玄武，占事定主失脱。例如乙亥日第三局为蒿矢格，酉乘玄武、加亥发用（昼占）；丙子日第五局为弹射格，申乘玄武、加子发用，昼将；己巳日第十一局为弹射格，亥乘玄武、加酉发用；辛丑日第四局为别责课，巳乘玄武、加申发用，夜将；庚午日第十二局为昴星课，戌加酉发用。又庚子日第九局为元首课，辰空亡、乘玄武、加子发用；辛亥日第八局，卯加戌发用、昼将玄武。此类是日干空亡、乘玄武为用，但初传并非遥克、昴星。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙亥日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 未 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：陷空乘玄格 · 乙亥日第三局（昼占·蒿矢遥克），初传酉空乘玄武、加亥发用（人宅失盗）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"财空乘元格-应防失脱\">财空乘元格：应防失脱</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">财空乘元格，或临支发用，亦防失脱。如甲子日戌加子，昼占上乘元武，此例极多。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 35 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日财空亡、乘玄武、临支发用，为财空乘元格。占课得此，应防失脱。如甲子日第三局，戌空亡、加子发用、上乘玄武，属此格。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 申 → 午</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：财空乘元格 · 甲子日第三局（昼占·戌加子），初传戌为日财、空亡乘玄武（应防失脱）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"鬼脱乘元格-来意占失脱\">鬼脱乘元格：来意占失脱</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">鬼脱乘元格，缘日鬼或脱气乘元武，来意占失脱，为发用尤的。如己酉日卯加酉昼，辛丑日亥加丑夜。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 35 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日鬼或脱气乘玄武，为鬼脱乘元格。来意占失脱，如果发用则更是如此。如己酉日第七局，卯加酉，昼占；辛丑日第三局，亥加丑，夜占。均属此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己酉日第 7 局　月将 子 加占时 午　（返吟·无依）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 酉 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：鬼脱乘元格 · 己酉日第七局（返吟·昼占·卯加酉），初末传卯木日鬼空亡乘玄武（来意占失脱）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：干支上皆乘脱气，人被脱赚、宅遭盗窃</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　干上支上皆乘脱气，或干上脱支、支上脱干。</p>\n<p>⭐ 人被脱赚、宅遭盗窃；占病因盖屋费用致气脱，宜服补药。失脱乘玄武发用尤的。</p>\n<hr>", "bf36": "<h2 id=\"第-36-法-干支皆败势倾颓-人衰屋败\">第 36 法　干支皆败势倾颓：人衰屋败</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　占兵同前</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"干支皆败格-身宅衰败\">干支皆败格：身宅衰败</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓干支上皆逢败气者。占身气血衰败，占宅屋舍崩颓，日渐狼狈，全无长进，更不可捕捉奸私，告讦他人阴事，倘若到官，必牵连我之旧过，同时败露，各获罪也。其余占用，彼此皆值衰败，乃应俗谚云：「杀人一万，自损三千</q>之意也。如甲申日干上子、支上午，庚寅日干上午、支上子，丙申、丙寅日干上卯。」 <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 36 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干支上皆逢败气，即为此法。占得此课，主身气血衰败、宅屋崩塌颓败，日渐狼狈、全无长进；占捕捉、奸私、告讼他人阴事亦为不吉，如若牵扯到官府，必牵连出以往的过失、失咎败露、各获其罪。干支上皆逢败气，就像俗谚所说<q class=\"yw\">杀人一万，自损三千</q>。例如甲申日第三局，干上子、支上午；庚寅日第三局，干上午、支上子；丙申日、丙寅日第三局，干上卯。均属此例。（败气＝十二长生之<q class=\"yw\">沐浴</q>位，如甲木败在子、庚金败在午。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲申日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 辰 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：干支皆败格 · 甲申日第三局，干上子（甲之败气）、支上午，干支皆逢败气（身宅衰败·初传午空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"破败神临宅格-因人败家\">破败神临宅格：因人败家</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">破败神临宅格，缘支上有败气，又为破碎煞，必宅中有人不利，而致日渐衰残，家道破败，宜详其破败者类神是何人。如己巳、己亥二日，干上乘酉，乃干之败气又作支之破碎，故总名为破败神也。以类推之，昼占必家中有破败之子，缘酉为己土之子息故也；夜乘天后因妾败。又戊申、戊寅日干上酉，壬寅、壬申、癸巳、癸亥四日干上酉，并同其酉为婢类，亦缘酒色而败家。其余破败神临之同说。一说破败神临干主凶，非临支。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 36 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支上有败气、又为破碎煞，为破败神临宅格。主宅中有破败之人，致使家道日渐衰残、破败不堪。具体占断，应详看破败者的类神、断定何人为破败之人。又有一说：破败神临干主凶、而非临支。如己巳日、己亥日第十一局，干上乘酉，酉为干之败气、又为支之破碎煞，总称破败神；昼占主家中有破败之子（酉为己土之子孙），夜占乘天后主因妾而败。又戊申、戊寅日第九局干上酉；壬寅、壬申、癸巳、癸亥日第五局干上酉，酉为奴婢，主因酒色而败家。其余破败神例与此同。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己亥日第 11 局　月将 申 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>丑 → 卯 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：破败神临宅格 · 己亥日第十一局，干上酉为干之败气兼支之破碎煞（破败神临·因人败家·末传巳空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：干支上皆逢败气，身衰宅颓、日渐狼狈</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　干支上皆逢败气。</p>\n<p>⭐ 占身气血衰败、占宅崩颓，日渐狼狈；不可捕奸告讦，到官反牵连旧过（杀人一万自损三千）。</p>\n<hr>", "bf37": "<h2 id=\"第-37-法-末助初兮三等论-三种格局的推断\">第 37 法　末助初兮三等论：三种格局的推断</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　占兵视其或利主或利客</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"末助初生干格-暗中举荐\">末助初生干格：暗中举荐</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓末传助其初传而生日干者，亦有末助初而克干者，亦有末助初传而作日之财神者，此三等皆是，傍有相助而和各成其上说。内末助初生日者，欲年命制末始可言吉，年命生末反凶。二等者，如辛酉日末传巳加子，助其初传之未土生日干者例。必傍有人暗地相助推荐而致亨旺，如值末传空亡，亦名闲话多赤心少也。六戊日伏吟，己巳伏吟，己丑、辛亥、己巳、己卯、己亥、己未、辛酉七日并干上子。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 37 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　末传助初传的格局分三等：一是末助初传生日干，二是末助初传克日干，三是末助初传作日财，皆主傍有相助。末传助初传而生日干，主有人暗地相助推荐而致亨旺；须年命克制末传方可言吉，年命生末传反而为凶；如果末传空亡，便成闲话多、真心少。例如辛酉日第八局，末传巳加子，助其初传未土、未土生日干辛金。又六戊日伏吟课，己巳日第一局伏吟课，己丑、己巳、己卯、己未、己亥日第八局，辛亥、辛酉日第八局，干上子。均属此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛酉日第 8 局　月将 申 加占时 卯　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 子 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：末助初生干格 · 辛酉日第八局，末传巳生初传未土、未土生辛金日干（暗中举荐·中传子空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"末助初鬼格-因财致祸\">末助初鬼格：因财致祸</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如庚午日干上午，三传午辰寅，末传寅加辰，生起初传午火而克伐庚金，末传之寅木乃教唆词讼之人也。其为公曹吏道士，为胡须人，或属虎人，或姓从木，详天将逐类而言之，尤不宜求财取财，反为祸也。又庚辰、庚申二日寅加辰，辛未日卯加戌，甲辰日辰加子。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 37 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　末传助初传而克日干，为末助初鬼格，主因财致祸或被人诬告，尤其不宜求财、取财，否则反成灾祸。例如庚午日第三局，干上午，三传午辰寅，末传寅加辰，生起初传午火克伐日干庚金；末传寅木即为教唆词讼之人——为公曹吏、道士、有胡须之人、属虎之人或木旁姓氏，以天将类神推断。又庚辰、庚申日第三局寅加辰，辛未日第八局卯加戌，甲辰日第九局辰加子。均属此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚午日第 3 局　月将 卯 加占时 巳　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 子 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>午→辰→寅</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>寅→子→戌</strong>（涉害；分歧类型：<strong>涉害深浅</strong>）。 原书注：末助初鬼格 · 庚午日第三局，末传寅生初传午火、午火克庚金日干（因财致祸·不宜求财）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"末助初财格-暗中财助\">末助初财格：暗中财助</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">三等者，如甲辰日干上子，三传戌申午，末传午加申，助其初传之戌土而作甲干之财者，凡占值此，必暗有人以财相助也。如占博弈，宜此末助初为财者作例，来意占婚尤的。如甲寅、甲午、癸未日干上子。末助初传作日财反克干上神者。如甲子日干上子，三传戌申午；又壬申日干上酉，三传午辰寅同。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 37 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　末传助初传而作日干之财，为第三种格局，主暗中有人以财相助；此例宜占博弈，来意占婚尤为准确。例如甲辰日第三局，干上子，三传戌申午，末传午加申，助初传戌土、戌土作甲干之财。甲寅日、甲午日第三局，癸未日第二局，干上子，均属此例。又有末助初传作日财、反克干上神者：如甲子日第三局，干上子，三传戌申午；壬申日第三局，干上酉，三传午辰寅。即属此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 3 局　月将 卯 加占时 巳　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 申 → 午</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：末助初财格 · 甲子日第三局，末传午生初传戌土、戌土作甲干之财，反克干上神子水（暗中财助·初传戌空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"抱鸡不斗格-无意克干\">抱鸡不斗格：无意克干</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">抱鸡不斗格，缘己亥、己酉日卯丑亥为传，庚寅日午辰寅为传，癸亥日丑卯巳为传。虽末助初而克日干者，因初传或空亡或落空本无意克其日干，其末传徒为怨憎，奈初传无力终不能克干，故取喻于抱鸡不斗之例也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 37 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　末传助初传克日干，但初传乘空、落空，为抱鸡不斗格。初传本无意克其日干，末传徒成怨憎，初传无力、终不能克干，故以抱鸡不斗为喻——虽有争斗，但不会导致灾祸。己亥日、己酉日第三局，三传卯丑亥；庚寅日第三局，三传午辰寅；癸亥日第十一局，三传丑卯巳。均属此例。（己亥日甲午旬空辰巳，初传卯落地盘巳位，即<q class=\"yw\">落空</q>。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己亥日第 3 局　月将 卯 加占时 巳　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 丑 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：抱鸡不斗格 · 己亥日第三局，初传卯克己土日干却落于旬空巳地（无意克干·虽斗无祸）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"枉做恶人格-教唆败露\">枉做恶人格：教唆败露</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">枉做恶人格，如庚戌日午辰寅为三传，末空，干上午；又庚子日午辰寅为三传，末传落空亦是。末助初传而克日干者，缘末传空亡不能助其初传，其教唆人必自败露，所以喻枉做恶人也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 37 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　末传助初传克干，但末传空亡、助力贫乏，为枉做恶人格。主教唆他人，必自败露。例如庚戌日第三局，三传午辰寅，末传寅空亡，干上午；庚子日第三局，三传午辰寅，末传落空。均属此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚戌日第 3 局　月将 卯 加占时 巳　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 辰 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：枉做恶人格 · 庚戌日第三局，末传寅旬空、不能助初传午克庚（教唆败露·末传寅空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"谒求祸出格-谒求有祸\">谒求祸出格：谒求有祸</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谒求祸出格，乃支上神作财生干上神为鬼者。大不利谒贵求财，犯之即有祸出。如甲子甲午日干上酉，甲辰甲戌日干上申，乙亥乙巳日干上酉，乙卯乙酉日干上申，丙寅日干上子、又干上亥。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 37 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支上神作日财、生干上神，干上神为日鬼，为谒求祸出格。占得此课，大都不利于谒贵、求财，否则便有灾祸。如甲子日、甲午日第六局，干上酉；甲辰日、甲戌日第七局，干上申；乙亥日、乙巳日第八局，干上酉；乙卯日、乙酉日第九局，干上申；丙寅日第六局干上子、第七局干上亥。均属此例。（书图盘：甲子日第六局，支上未作甲财、生干上酉，酉金为甲木之鬼。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 6 局　月将 戌 加占时 卯　（知一）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 酉 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：谒求祸出格 · 甲子日第六局，支上未土作财生干上酉金、酉为甲木之鬼（谒贵求财有祸）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"自招其祸格-必致患害\">自招其祸格：必致患害</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">自招其祸格，缘年命自助其初传而克干者。乃自招其祸，必致患害也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 37 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　年命助其初传克干，为自招其祸格。主自招灾祸，必致患害。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：末传助初，分生干、克干、作财三等而断</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　末传助其初传，分生干、克干、作财三等。</p>\n<p>⭐ 助初生干则欲年命制末方吉；助初克干为教唆词讼之人；助初作财为暗有人以财相助。</p>\n<hr>", "bf38": "<h2 id=\"第-38-法-闭口卦体两般推-捕贼捉盗\">第 38 法　闭口卦体两般推：捕贼捉盗</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　捕盗亦可察</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"闭口格-一-追捕盗贼\">闭口格（一）：追捕盗贼</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">《心镜》云：阳神作元武，度四是终阴。闭口卦止宜捕盗贼而追逃亡，此课纵值，目前时师多未尝拈出，故立成法于后。地盘旬首上神乘元武者，每日有一二课推之，如甲子旬中，甲子日辰戌加子，昼夜皆乘元武；戊辰戌加子昼夜，乙丑日卯加子昼，乙丑日亥加子夜，戊辰日辰加子夜昼，庚午日戌加子昼夜，庚午日辰加子昼夜，己巳日卯加子昼，己巳日亥加子夜，丙寅日伏吟夜，丙寅日申加子昼，丙寅日寅加子昼，丁卯伏吟夜，丁卯日返吟夜。甲申旬中，甲申日辰戌加申昼夜，戊子日辰加申昼夜，又戌加申昼夜，庚寅日辰戌加申昼夜，乙酉亥加申夜，卯加申昼，丙戌日子午加申夜又返吟、伏吟昼，丁亥日午子加申夜、返吟伏吟昼，壬辰日子午加申夜、返吟伏吟昼，乙酉日巳加申夜、酉加申昼。甲戌旬中，凡甲戌庚返吟、伏吟昼夜皆是，乙亥日巳亥加戌夜、卯酉加戌昼，己卯日卯酉加戌昼，己亥加戌夜。甲午、甲辰、甲寅三旬，止有天盘之旬首乘元武，无地盘旬首乘元武，因元武不到东南方也，亦可如其说。凡旬尾加旬首作元武者，惟甲子甲申二旬，甲戌旬无之。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 38 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　占得闭口课，只宜捕盗贼、追逃亡之人。闭口正例为地盘旬首上神乘玄武，每日均有一两课。例如甲子旬中，甲子日第九局辰加子、第三局戌加子，昼夜皆乘玄武；戊辰日、庚午日同；乙丑日第十局卯加子昼乘、第二局亥加子夜乘；己巳日第二局卯加子昼乘、亥加子夜乘；丙寅日第一局伏吟夜乘、第五局申加子昼乘、第十一局寅加子昼乘；丁卯日第一局伏吟夜乘、第七局返吟夜乘。甲申旬中，甲申日第五局辰加申、第十一局戌加申昼夜乘，戊子、庚寅日同；乙酉日第十局亥加申夜乘、第六局卯加申昼乘、第四局巳加申夜乘、第十二局酉加申昼乘；丙戌日第九局子加申、第三局午加申夜乘；丁亥、壬辰日第三局、第九局夜乘，第七局返吟、第一局伏吟昼乘。甲戌旬中，甲、戊、庚日返吟伏吟昼夜皆是；乙亥日第六局、第十二局巳亥加戌夜乘、卯酉加戌昼乘；己卯日第八局、第二局卯酉加戌昼乘、己亥加戌夜乘。甲午、甲辰、甲寅三旬只有天盘旬首乘玄武、没有地盘旬首乘玄武，因玄武不到东南方。旬尾加旬首作玄武，只有甲子、甲申两旬有，甲戌旬没有。（书图盘：甲申日第四局，旬尾癸巳加旬首甲申发用，三传巳寅亥，初传巳申六合、末传寅亥六合，气塞于中，正是闭口卦体。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲申日第 4 局　月将 子 加占时 卯　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 寅 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：闭口格（一）· 甲申日第四局，旬尾巳加旬首申发用，初末上下六合、气塞于中（追捕盗贼）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"闭口格-二-气塞于中\">闭口格（二）：气塞于中</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">旬尾加旬首为发用者例，更值初末上下六合，则气塞于中。如占病即是痖重或患禁口痢，不然咽喉肿塞，或痰厥症，不纳饮食，如占胎产定是哑儿，如占失脱纵有傍人见其贼盗窃物，竟不肯言之，凡求人说事，人但闭口而不语有无之意。余占更详天将而言其事类，且如上乘贵人，告贵不允，上乘朱雀，占讼屈枉难伸，乘白虎占讼使人不明而伏罪，余皆仿此。但不免应闭口之意，此法尤好，如甲申、丙戌、丁亥、壬辰、庚寅日并巳加申用，甲寅、戊午、癸亥、丙辰、丁巳、己未、庚申日并亥加寅，内惟丙辰、丁巳为闭口发用。若甲午、庚子、丁酉日卯加午，甲辰日丑加辰，乙巳日丑加辰，甲子、丁卯日酉加子，甲戌、乙亥未加戌，以上不必皆属闭口发用，但旬尾加旬首即有闭口之意，六旬中皆有。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 38 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　旬尾加旬首发用、再值初末传上下六合，主气塞于中：占病主痖重、禁口痢、咽喉肿塞、痰厥症、不纳饮食；占胎产主孕产哑儿；占失脱，即使有人看到盗贼窃物也不肯明言；求人说事，主闭口不说有无。其余占断再看天将类神：乘贵人主告贵不允；乘朱雀占讼主屈枉难伸；乘白虎占讼主用人不明而得罪。甲申、丙戌、丁亥、壬辰、庚寅日巳加申发用；甲寅、戊午、癸亥、丙辰、丁巳、己未、庚申日亥加寅（其中只有丙辰、丁巳日为闭口发用）；甲午、庚子、丁酉日卯加午，甲辰、乙巳日丑加辰，甲子、丁卯日酉加子，甲戌、乙亥日未加戌——以上不必皆属闭口发用，但只要旬尾加旬首，即有闭口之意，六旬中皆有此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙午日第 4 局　月将 子 加占时 卯　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 酉 → 午</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"warn\"><p>原书注：闭口格（二）· 丙午日第四局，旬尾丑加旬首辰（地盘辰位上神丑），旬尾加旬首即有闭口之意（⚠书图标题误作丙戌日，据盘面遁干壬子/己酉/丙午与三四课卯午/子卯，当为丙午日，照盘面复现）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"禄作闭口-不利占病\">禄作闭口：不利占病</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">禄作闭口，缘辛未日酉加寅，大不利占病，缘日禄作闭口，非旬尾加旬首。如乙未日卯加申酉，夜又乘白虎，或乘元武，不在传课，就天盘言也，亦非旬尾加旬首，辛未日酉加戌夜亦乘白虎，外有丙戌、戊子日巳为闭口禄神，但不乘虎，壬戌日亥为闭口，亦无白虎。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 38 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日禄作闭口，如辛未日第六局，酉加寅，大多不利占病，并非旬尾加旬首。乙未日第六局及第七局，卯加申、酉，夜乘白虎或玄武，不在传课、就天盘而言，也不是旬尾加旬首。辛未日第二局，酉加戌，夜乘白虎。另外丙戌日、戊子日，巳为闭口禄神，但不乘白虎；壬戌日，亥为闭口，亦无白虎。（书图盘：辛未日第六局，辛禄在酉、酉加寅发用，三传酉辰亥。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛未日第 6 局　月将 戌 加占时 卯　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 辰 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：禄作闭口 · 辛未日第六局，日禄酉加寅发用作闭口（不利占病·末传亥空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"财作闭口或食神空亡-不利占病\">财作闭口或食神空亡：不利占病</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">财作闭口或食神空亡，皆如前说。丙寅日干支上酉，丁卯日干支上酉，甲戌日干支上未，壬辰、癸巳日干支上巳，庚子、辛丑日干上卯，甲辰、乙巳日干支上丑，戊午、己未日干支上亥。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 38 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　财作闭口或食神空亡，占断如前例。丙寅日第九局、第六局，干支上酉；丁卯日第十一局、第七局，干支上酉；甲戌日第八局、第四局，干支上未；壬辰日第七局、第十二局，癸巳日第九局、第一局，干支上巳；庚子日第六局、第十局，辛丑日第八局、第十一局，干上卯；甲辰日第二局、第四局，乙巳日第四局、第五局，干支上丑；戊午日第七局、第八局，己未日第九局，干支上亥。（书图盘：丙寅日第九局，干上酉为丙之财、作闭口，三传酉丑巳。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙寅日第 9 局　月将 未 加占时 卯　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：财作闭口 · 丙寅日第九局，干上酉金作丙火之财为闭口（不利占病）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：旬首上神乘玄武，占病禁口、诸事闭口不语</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　地盘旬首上神乘玄武（旬尾加旬首亦然）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 宜捕盗追逃；占病禁口痢咽喉塞、占产哑儿、占失脱旁人不言、求事人闭口不语。</p>\n<hr>", "bf39": "<h2 id=\"第-39-法-太阳照武宜擒贼-贼必败露\">第 39 法　太阳照武宜擒贼：贼必败露</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　不利劫营伐路</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"太阳照武格-一-盗贼现形\">太阳照武格（一）：盗贼现形</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓元武坐于太阳月将之上，占贼必败，缘贼人喜夜而可以隐形，岂宜被太阳之光照耀，以致盗贼之形现露，不劳捕捉，必然自败。纵太阳月将乘天空或作空亡，及坐空亡尤好，缘太阳不被云翳，更光明也。惟畏占时在夜，贼反大幸也。尤宜逐季推寻日出日入之时，极准。如止以卯为日出，酉为日入，则元武止有临地盘之申上者为昼，缘不临地寅卯辰巳午未故也。如推究节气，日出日入，则元武纵临酉戌，尚可作太阳照武之用也。如壬申日返吟卦，十月占，且支上寅木乃是日之盗气，上又乘元武，必是家中人作盗，后必败露，缘寅为月将照破元武故也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 39 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　玄武坐于太阳（月将）之上，为太阳照武格。玄武为癸亥极阴之神、又为贼，喜阴忌阳、喜暗忌明；太阳即月将，光照天下，盗贼无处藏身，故占贼必败：贼人喜夜中隐遁，在太阳之光下露出行藏，自然易于捕捉。即使太阳乘天空、作空亡、坐空亡，太阳也不会被乌云遮挡，反而更加光明。但如果占时为夜时，贼反而难捉：卯至申为昼占、太阳当空，光芒四射，贼必败露；酉至寅为夜占、太阳落山，利贼隐匿，故态难获。例如壬申日第七局，为返吟卦，十月占，支上寅木为日之盗气、上乘玄武，主家中人作盗、后必败露，这是因寅为月将、照破玄武的缘故。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬申日第 7 局　月将 寅 加占时 申　（返吟·无依）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 申 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：太阳照武格（一）· 壬申日第七局返吟，十月占月将寅，支上寅木为日之盗气、上乘玄武，寅为月将照破玄武（家贼败露·昼占）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"太阳照武格-二-夜占难获\">太阳照武格（二）：夜占难获</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如辛亥日亥将戌时，三传丑寅卯，此课所合主失脱而无疑也。缘干上亥是日之盗神又乘元武，又初传是日之墓神，中传虽寅卯为日财，又是旬空，虽是太阳照武，奈何是戌时，太阳已归地下，其贼难获，此例极多，余皆仿此。至元武虽不临太阳之上，如于卯辰巳午申天盘之上者，尚可捕盗，或元武临天马六丁，更临酉戌亥子丑上，其贼终不败露，必至远窜。如占失财，其财坐长生之上者，终不致失，或所失物类坐于长生之上者，亦不至失也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 39 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　辛亥日第十二局，亥将加戌时，三传丑寅卯，此课主失脱无疑：干上亥为日之盗神、又乘玄武，初传丑是日干辛金之墓神，中末传寅卯虽为日财、又是旬空；虽是太阳照武的格局，但占时为戌时，太阳已经西下，故主贼难捕获。此例极多，其余以此类推。另外，玄武不临太阳之上，但临于卯、辰、巳、午、申之上，也主可以捕盗；但如果玄武临天马、六丁，更临酉、戌、亥、子、丑上，主贼终不会败露，必然远窜。如占失财，财坐长生之上，主财终不致失；所失的物类坐于长生之上，也主不会失脱。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛亥日第 12 局　月将 亥 加占时 戌　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>丑 → 寅 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：太阳照武格（二）· 辛亥日第十二局夜占（亥将戌时），干上亥盗神乘玄武、初传丑为辛墓、中末寅卯财皆旬空，戌时太阳归地下（贼难获·四课三课备，三传照原著丑寅卯直录）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"天网四张格-最宜占贼\">天网四张格：最宜占贼</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">天网四张格，最宜占贼必获，谓用神与正时同克日是也，惟在破网卦反难捉贼矣。破网者，有神克其初传是也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 39 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　用神（发用）与正时均克日干，为天网四张格。占得此格，最宜占捕贼，必然捕获。只有破网卦反而难以捉贼——破网卦，指有神克制其初传。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"贼向防连坐者例-贼有同党\">贼向防连坐者例：贼有同党</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">贼向防连坐者例，缘元武所临之神有神作六合是也。如元武加子临丑，子与丑作六合故也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 39 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　玄武所乘之神与下神作六合，主贼有同党。如玄武乘子临丑，子与丑作六合；乘酉临辰等，同此。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"捉贼不如赶贼格-捉贼耗费\">捉贼不如赶贼格：捉贼耗费</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">捉贼不如赶贼格，假令甲日占，以申为贼，不可便以丙火克之，虽去其鬼贼，亦窃甲干之气，尤忧所费。以此推之，不如以壬水暗窃其申金尤生其甲木为妙。游都下捉贼必获，游都煞者，甲己日丑，乙庚日子，丙辛日寅，丁壬日巳，戊癸日申。元武加丁主失脱。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 39 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　玄武乘官鬼，子孙为捕盗之神，子孙虽克官鬼，但也脱泄日干，不如以父母化官鬼玄武之气而生干——捉贼必有脱耗，不如驱走盗贼。如甲日占，以申为贼，不可便以丙火克之，虽去其鬼贼，亦窃甲干之气；不如以壬水暗窃申金、又生甲木为妙。（本书编者注：原书举甲日申鬼乘玄武为例，不论阳贵未、阴贵丑，顺行逆行至申均不能乘玄武，属举例有误。）游都之下捉贼必获。游都煞：甲己日丑，乙庚日子，丙辛日寅，丁壬日巳，戊癸日申。如甲子日巳时寅将占，未土昼贵居戌逆行，至戌上乘玄武、戌土临丑，丑为甲日游都煞。玄武乘神遁丁、或临丁马所乘之神，均主贼逃失。如乙亥日第三局昼占，亥水乘玄武临丑，丑在甲戌旬中遁丁，是玄武加丁神。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"贼捉贼格-以贼制贼\">贼捉贼格：以贼制贼</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">贼捉贼格，如壬癸日辰戌未丑等为传，三传自相刑冲，可以凶制凶，又内有四金字可以化鬼也。又元之本家上神能制元亦是。鬼作生气，贼来不已，如日之劫财，或占失财，亦以此为贼，或鬼贼本家与元武本家上神乘太阳，占盗立获。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 39 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　贼捉贼格：如壬癸日，辰、戌、未、丑为三传，自相刑冲，以凶制凶，而且内有四金字可以化鬼。又玄武本家（亥）上神能克制玄武乘神，亦属此格——如丙寅日第七局返吟课昼占，午火上乘玄武，午上神子水克制午火，为本家上神能制玄武。鬼作生气：玄武乘神为日鬼、又作本月生气或坐生者，主贼来不已、连续遇盗。如六乙日十月占，酉金鬼杀乘玄武又为本月生气，主此贼连续作案。或占得失财，或鬼贼本家与玄武本家上神乘太阳，主占破获盗贼。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：玄武坐太阳月将之上，贼形现露、不劳自败</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　玄武坐于太阳月将之上。</p>\n<p>⭐ 贼形现露、不劳捕捉必自败；纵太阳空亡尤好，惟畏占时在夜（太阳已归地下）。</p>\n<hr>", "bf40": "<h2 id=\"第-40-法-后合占婚岂用媒-男女私情\">第 40 法　后合占婚岂用媒：男女私情</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　大过九五枯杨生花，家人九三嗃嗃嘻嘻，占兵有敌与臣下私谋者</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"干支后合格-男女私情\">干支后合格：男女私情</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓干为夫，支为妻，凡占婚全看此。岂宜支干上乘天后、六合，以应私情，那更女之行年居在干上，男之行年居在支上，此乃私情，先相交通，至嫁娶之时，何有用媒伐乎。如占婚值此者，必有先奸后娶之意也。如丁卯日干上寅，昼乘六合，支上戌乘天后，又干上子夜乘六合，支上申乘天后，又干上戌乘天后，支上午乘六合夜。更看那边空亡，审其真伪，如值空亡，则虽乘天后、六合，既已坐空，乃止怀虚意也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 40 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　六合为和合之神，天后为阴私之神。干为夫，支为妻，凡占婚全看此。支干上乘天后、六合，主有私情；如女子行年加于干上、男子行年加于支上，亦主有私情。不论男女占婚，遇到这些情况，均主先有私情而后结婚（先奸后娶）。例如丁卯日第六局昼占，丁上神寅木乘六合，支上神戌土乘天后；又干上子夜乘六合、支上申乘天后；又干上戌乘天后、支上午乘六合（夜占）。更要看哪边空亡、审其真伪：如值空亡，虽乘天后、六合，既已坐空，只怀虚情假意——丁卯日属甲子旬，戌亥空，戌土乘天后旬空，主女方虚意。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁卯日第 6 局　月将 戌 加占时 卯　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 巳 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：干支后合格 · 丁卯日第六局昼占，干上寅乘六合、支上戌乘天后又值旬空（男女私情·女方虚意；书无盘图，据原文丁卯日第六局昼占例起盘复现）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（婚孕）：干支上乘天后六合，主先奸后娶、私情</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　干为夫、支为妻，干支上乘天后、六合，或男女行年互居干支。</p>\n<p>⭐ 主先奸后娶、私情之象；看何边空亡以审真伪，空则止怀虚意。</p>\n<hr>"});